doc:Factsarticle1_69 schema1:text "Particular emphasis is placed on verifying the design assumptions of the four main algorithms (AE, LSTM-AE, OCSVM, IF) and on substantiating the research novelty, which stems from the empirical testing of their stability in the unique scenario of inverted class imbalance." .
