	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:c55edc3303b3 .
doc:Factsarticle1_69 schema1:text "This work focuses on the specific context of an urban wind turbine in S Ã£ o Paulo, where operational states other than the optimal status, 'Normal. Run with energy generation' (e.g., Low Windspeed, Braking, Waiting), are classified as operational anomalies from the perspective of maximizing energy production." .
_:f17ba3b67c2fcc67a108ce46bf35f895 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsarticle1_69 schema1:text "This work focuses on the specific context of an urban wind turbine in S Ã£ o Paulo, where operational states other than the optimal status, 'Normal. Run with energy generation' (e.g., Low Windspeed, Braking, Waiting), are classified as operational anomalies from the perspective of maximizing energy production." )>> ;
