doc:Factsarticle1_69 schema1:text "The main goal of this article is to conduct a rigorous, empirical, and quantitative comparison of the performance and methodological stability of four distinct unsupervised models-Autoencoder, LSTM-Autoencoder, One-Class SVM (OCSVM), and Isolation Forest (IF)-in the task of binary operational anomaly detection under conditions of an extremely anomaly-dominated SCADA dataset." .
